OL,3,GNEWSAFog warning issued across the East
OL,4,Aof England
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been warned travel is
OL,7,Flikely to be disrupted due to fog
OL,8,Facross the East of England.
OL,10,FA yellow weather warning has been put
OL,11,Fin place until 10:00 GMT, the Met
OL,12,FOffice said.
OL,14,FFog might be dense in some areas and is
OL,15,Fexpected to cause slower journey times
OL,16,Fwith delays to bus and train services
OL,17,Fand flight issues, it added.
OL,19,FThe Met Office urged drivers to check
OL,20,Froad conditions and for anyone
OL,21,Ftravelling to allow extra time for
OL,22,Fjourneys.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
